---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import FAQSchema from "../../../components/FAQSchema.astro";
import ServiceVideoProof from "../../../components/ServiceVideoProof.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Upholstery Cleaning in Brossard | Sofa, Sectional, Fabric Furniture"
  description="Professional upholstery cleaning in Brossard for sectionals, modular sofas, armchairs and fabric furniture. Steam cleaning, professional shampoo, eco-friendly products and fast drying."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Sofa, Sectional and Upholstery Cleaning in Brossard</h1>
      <p>
        In Brossard, modern condos and family homes often rely on large sectionals and modular sofas as the center of everyday living. Our professional upholstery
        cleaning service is built for that reality: deep, fabric-safe cleaning that restores freshness while respecting premium furniture finishes.
      </p>
      <div class="upholstery-local-hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary pulse-btn" href="tel:5148939939">
          <span class="cta-btn-stack">
            <span>Call for a Fast Estimate</span>
            <span class="cta-btn-phone-num">(514) 893-9939</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="btn btn-gradient-green"
          onclick="window.openEstimationWidget()"
        >
          Request a Free Estimate
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section svp-section-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <ServiceVideoProof
        title="See our upholstery cleaning in action"
        subtitle="Real example of in-home sofa cleaning"
        description="Watch a real job and see our professional method for cleaning upholstered furniture right in the client's home."
        youtubeId="auWtvSvqucg"
        youtubeTitle="Stained sofa cleaning in Saint-Bruno-de-Montarville"
        allVideosHref="/en/video-gallery/"
        videoAspectRatio="9 / 16"
        playLabel="Watch the video"
        allVideosLabel="See all our projects"
        closeLabel="Close video"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-light">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Local Service in Brossard</h2>
      <p>
        We provide in-home upholstery cleaning across Brossard with a method designed for residential spaces. Before starting, we inspect fabric type, seam condition
        and high-contact zones to define the safest and most effective treatment plan.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Professional Upholstery Cleaning Matters</h2>
      <p>
        Upholstered seating traps fine dust, allergens, body oils and everyday residues. Professional cleaning helps maintain appearance, improve comfort and extend the
        lifespan of your sofa, sectional and armchairs.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Professional Method</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Full pre-cleaning fabric inspection.</li>
        <li>Fiber-specific pre-treatment with professional shampoo.</li>
        <li>Steam cleaning with hot water extraction.</li>
        <li>Floor and pathway protection during setup and cleaning.</li>
        <li>Powerful extraction for fast drying, typically between 2 and 6 hours.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Furniture We Clean</h2>
      <p>
        We clean sectional sofas, modular sofas, loveseats, armchairs, upholstered dining chairs, banquette seating and ottomans. Every piece is treated according to
        fabric composition, soil level and usage pattern.
      </p>

      <h2>Specialized Treatments Available</h2>
      <p>
        Based on the initial assessment, we can add targeted stain treatment, odor neutralization, enzymatic treatment and optional fabric protection. We recommend only
        what is relevant for your specific upholstery condition.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Homeowners in Brossard Choose Empire</h2>
      <p>
        With over 30 years of experience, our team combines technical precision, eco-friendly products and consistent service quality. We focus on clean execution and
        reliable results for homeowners who expect professional standards.
      </p>

      <h2>Brossard FAQ</h2>
      <FAQSchema
        faqs={[
          {
            question: "Do you clean large sectionals in Brossard condos?",
            answer:
              "Yes. We frequently clean large sectionals and modular sofas in condo settings, with a process adapted to access constraints and fabric requirements.",
          },
          {
            question: "Can you clean light-colored upholstery safely?",
            answer:
              "Yes. We select products and techniques based on fiber type and soiling level to clean effectively while protecting delicate or light fabrics.",
          },
          {
            question: "How long before we can use the furniture again?",
            answer:
              "Most upholstery dries within 2 to 6 hours, depending on fabric, airflow and indoor humidity.",
          },
        ]}
      />

      <h2>Request an Estimate</h2>
      <p>
        For a quick quote on sofa, sectional, armchair or fabric furniture cleaning in Brossard, contact Empire Cleaning Group at (514) 893-9939.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .upholstery-local-hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .upholstery-local-hero-cta .cta-btn-stack {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    line-height: 1.25;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .upholstery-local-hero-cta .cta-btn-phone-num {
    font-size: 0.92em;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
</style>
